Here's the assert statement:

<code>assert this.size() == ((ArrayList<?>) \result).size() && \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < this.size(); this.get(i).equals(((ArrayList<?>) \result).get(i));</code>

This assert statement checks that the size of the cloned list is the same as the original list and that each element at index `i` in the cloned list is equal to the element at index `i` in the original list.
